 or email:\n📧 **torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com**\n\n**Come for the ghosts. 👻**\n**Stay for the stories.**\n**Leave with a new connection — and maybe a new friend.** 🖤","startDate":"2026-10-02T23:00:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-1-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Queen's Park Legislative Assembly of Ontario","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Toronto","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"1 Queens Park, Toronto, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"No Such Thing As Bad Weather Walking & Hiking Group!","url":"https://www.meetup.com/no-such-thing-as-bad-weather/"},"performer":"No Such Thing As Bad Weather Walking & Hiking Group!"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"Dinner and Drinks At Storm Crow Manor","url":"https://www.meetup.com/meetup-group-iahohgwj/events/316741992/","description":"Come join us for dinner and drinks at Storm Crow Manor and check out Toronto’s geekiest bar.\nMeet new amazing people and have great conversations.\nAfterwards, if people wish, we can explore the neighbourhood.\n\nFrom Storm Crow Manor:\n\n“Toronto's geekiest bar opened in late 2018 in a historical Church Street mansion. Behind the bookcase: a secret submarine chamber. Up the stairs: a mad scientist laboratory bar. Down the hall: a cyberpunk lounge bathed in neon and holograms. Sacrifices — we mean, guests — of all ages welcome.”\n\nLet’s have a great night together!\n\nPlease note there is a $5 charge for this meetup. Payment Options: E-transfers should be sent to [torontofriendsmeetup@gmail.com](mailto:torontofriendsmeetup@gmail.com)  Or PayPal Link:  [https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/torontofriendsmeetup](https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/torontofriendsmeetup)   \nOr you can pay cash in person.\n\nNote: refunds will only be issued in